<title>GERMANY: Munich airport cargo up 34.4pct in July.</title>
<headline>Munich airport cargo up 34.4pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo flown to and from Munich airport (MUC) grew 34.4 percent year-on-year in July, airport authority figures showed.</p>
<p>Exports continued to show strong double-figure growth, largely due to new intercontinental services, with a 46.4 percent rise, the monthly traffic report said.</p>
<p>The following table shows cargo handled at Munich airport in July and for the year to date in tonnes and with year-on-year percentage changes.</p>
<p>		  July   Pct change   Jan-July  Pct change</p>
<p>    Exports   4,405  Up 46.4	27,159    Up 35.7</p>
<p>    Imports   3,772  Up 22.7	24,999    Up 20.2</p>
<p>    Transit     765  Up 48.8	 4,697    Up 26.5</p>
<p>    Total     8,942  Up 35.5	56,855    Up 27.7</p>
<p>Source: Munich airport market research dept.</p>
